---
import { profile } from '../content/profile';
import { site } from '../content/site';
---
<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-14 pb-12 grid lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] gap-10 items-start">
  <div>
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono border border-border rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-muted">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span> Disponible para nuevos proyectos · Respuesta &lt;24h
    </div>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight">
      Construyo webs y apps <span class="text-primary">que convierten</span> y escalan.<br/>Audito lo que ya tienes. Decido contigo qué construir.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted max-w-2xl">{profile.summary}</p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/contacto" class="bg-primary text-bg px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-medium focus-ring">¿Hablamos de tu proyecto? →</a>
      <a href="/proyectos" class="border border-border px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:border-fg/30 transition focus-ring">Ver proyectos con métricas</a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-lg">
      {profile.proofs.map((p) => (
        <div class="border border-border rounded-xl p-3">
          <div class="text-xs text-muted">{p.label}</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xl font-bold">{p.value}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border border-border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-card terminal-glow">
    <div class="h-8 border-b border-border flex items-center px-4 gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-muted">
      <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/80" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/80" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400/80" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      pnpm ci && pnpm build
    </div>
    <pre class="p-4 text-[12px] leading-6 font-mono overflow-auto"><code>✓ Typecheck, lint y tests en verde
✓ axe-core: 0 violaciones en 6 rutas
✓ Lighthouse: 98 / 100 / 100 / 100 móvil
✓ Stripe webhooks idempotentes
▶ {site.url}
<span class="text-primary">✔ Deploy Vercel — 1.4s LCP</span></code></pre>
    <div class="px-4 pb-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[10px] font-mono">
      {profile.stackPills.map((t) => (
        <span class="border border-border rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-muted">{t}</span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="border-y border-border bg-card/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-xs font-mono text-muted">
    {profile.trustBar.map((item) => (
      <span>✓ {item}</span>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
